OL,3,ANew Zealand opposition leader calls on
OL,4,Aparties to 'work together' as election
OL,5,Acounting shows tight race
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe latest electoral commission data
OL,8,Fsuggests National is slightly ahead
OL,9,Fwith 29.36% of the vote compared to
OL,10,FLabour's 29.08%
OL,12,FMeanwhile, the centrist Opportunity
OL,13,FParty crosses the 5% threshold to enter
OL,14,Fparliament for the first time as the
OL,15,Fmajor parties see historically low
OL,16,Fvotes
OL,18,FNew Zealand's voting system - mixed
OL,19,Fmember proportional - means most
OL,20,Fgovernments are coalitions
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
